      "content": {
        "text": "They are 7 times the numbers 1 to 6. The average is therefore 7 times the average of 1 to 6:\n\n7 × (1 + 6) ÷ 2 = 24.5\n\nFor the first n multiples of k: average = k(n + 1)/2.",
