      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Only those five values count. They are equally spaced, so:\n\nAverage = (24 + 48) ÷ 2 = 36\n\nThe trap is averaging every number in the interval instead of the numbers that satisfy the condition.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
