        "text": "Add the next two numbers, 33 and 34. The new seven-number list runs from 28 to 34.\n\nNew average = (28 + 34) ÷ 2 = 31\n\nThe average rises by 1 because the centre of the longer run moves by 1.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
